{"availability":"available","full":"dimitriszoitas/aegis-ui","name":"aegis-ui","description":"Aegis, a floating-surface design system for AI-assisted SIEM products. React, Tailwind v4, shadcn, Storybook.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T10:40:16Z","updated":"2026-10-08T17:14:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dimitriszoitas.github.io/aegis-ui/","topics":[],"demo":"https://dimitriszoitas.github.io/aegis-ui/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:55.610Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:55.610Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:55.610Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:34:36.471Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:28:24.281Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T15:48:55.610Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live Storybook · Full DataGrid presentation · SIEM console","Aegis is a token-based React design system for engineers building SIEMs, developer tools, infrastructure consoles, and other code-first platforms. It includes independent light/dark color and Floating/Fixed layout themes, dense investigation tools, and reviewable AI interactions.","Storybook is the component reference and consumption guide. The repository also runs a marketing website and a complete SIEM console in Vite. The reusable design system is packaged as @dimitriszoitas/aegis-ui@0.1.0, with ESM modules, TypeScript declarations, compiled styles, and 91 public entry points. This release can be installed from a package archive; it has not been published to the npm registry."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dimitriszoitas/aegis-ui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a25681a14decf7e5a8b40f0902d2c30820cd85f2fafa847a91bd324ab2596497","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:36.652Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:36.652Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live Storybook · Full DataGrid prese